      "note": "A320 4X-ABW on approach, left side, near level, 2024-06-04. Fitted to shapes/A320.json (doors pinned, within 5 px): the rear facets' edges, the belly band, the fin's crescent and panel, the star's middle, the titles' ends and height. The light is dull: colours read against the fuselage's white and checked on the 2026 photos."
    },
